{{!
    @template format_aicourse/chatbox

    The AI Tutor panel. Rendered once per page inside the hero banner and hidden until the AI
    Tutor button in the hero is pressed.

    3.2.0: the panel has two views, switched by data-view on the root.
    * compact  - the floating panel (a bottom sheet on phones).
    * expanded - the Study view: a large centred workspace over a backdrop (full screen on phones)
                 with a rail holding the learner's context and the study tools, and a wider,
                 card-based conversation column.
    Both views are the same DOM; only CSS changes, so nothing is re-rendered and the conversation,
    focus and scroll position survive the switch.

    It is an ARIA dialog: role="dialog", aria-labelledby pointing at its own title, and aria-modal
    "false" in the compact view (it sits beside the page) or "true" in the Study view, which covers
    the page and traps Tab. The JavaScript keeps aria-modal in step with data-view. The message list is a role="log" aria-live="polite" region so replies, errors and the
    "Thinking…" state are announced, and it carries dir="auto" so a reply in a different script
    keeps its base direction. Opening, closing, the Tab focus trap, Escape and focus restoration
    are provided by format_aicourse/chatbox. Every SVG in here is decorative and therefore carries
    aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"; every icon-only button has an aria-label.

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-ai-chatbox - the panel root; shown/hidden by format_aicourse/chatbox.
    * aicourse-ai-backdrop - the Study view backdrop; clicking it returns to the compact view.
    * aicourse-ai-chatbox-close - closes the panel.
    * aicourse-ai-expand - switches between the compact and Study views.
    * aicourse-ai-newchat - clears the conversation.
    * aicourse-ai-quick-btn - sends the canned prompt named by data-prompt.
    * aicourse-ai-send-btn - sends the current textarea contents.
    * aicourse-ai-message, aicourse-ai-message-bot, aicourse-ai-message-content - matched by
      format_aicourse/chatbox when it updates the welcome message.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-view - on the panel root, compact or expanded.
    * data-prompt - on each quick action button, the key of the canned prompt to send. One of
      structure, concepts, workplace, practice, checklist.

    Element ids required for JS:
    * aicourse-ai-chatbox, aicourse-ai-backdrop, aicourse-ai-close, aicourse-ai-messages,
      aicourse-ai-welcome, aicourse-ai-quick-actions, aicourse-ai-suggest, aicourse-ai-input,
      aicourse-ai-send.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * closelabel string Accessible name of the close button.
    * inputlabel string Visually hidden label of the question textarea.
    * placeholder string Placeholder of the question textarea.
    * sendlabel string Accessible name and tooltip of the send button.
    * welcome string PRE-ESCAPED greeting. It is the aiassistant_welcome_name /
      aiassistant_welcome_section / aiassistant_welcome_activity language string, which
      legitimately contains <strong>, resolved with $a values that have already been through
      format_string(). It is therefore rendered with a triple mustache.
    * coursename string The course's name, already through format_string().
    * contextkind string "Activity", "Section" or "Course".
    * contexttitle string Name of the activity or section being studied, or the course name.
    * tools array The five study tools: key, label, desc and one is<key> icon flag each.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "closelabel": "Close",
        "inputlabel": "Your question for the AI Tutor",
        "placeholder": "Ask a question about the course...",
        "sendlabel": "Send message",
        "welcome": "Hi Sam! I see you're working on <strong>Week 1 quiz</strong>. What would you like help with?",
        "coursename": "Work Health and Safety",
        "contextkind": "Activity",
        "contexttitle": "Week 1 quiz",
        "tools": [
            {"key": "practice", "label": "Practice questions", "desc": "Test yourself", "ispractice": true}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="aicourse-ai-backdrop" id="aicourse-ai-backdrop" hidden></div>
<div id="aicourse-ai-chatbox" class="aicourse-ai-chatbox" style="display:none;" data-view="compact" role="dialog" aria-modal="false" aria-labelledby="aicourse-ai-chatbox-title">
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-header">
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-heading">
<span class="aicourse-ai-avatar aicourse-ai-avatar-head" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2M20 14h2M15 13v2M9 13v2"/></svg></span>
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-titles">
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-title" id="aicourse-ai-chatbox-title">{{#str}} aiassistant, format_aicourse {{/str}}</div>
{{#contexttitle}}<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-subtitle" dir="auto">{{contexttitle}}</div>{{/contexttitle}}
</div>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-actions">
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-headbtn aicourse-ai-newchat" aria-label="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_newchat, format_aicourse {{/cleanstr}}" title="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_newchat, format_aicourse {{/cleanstr}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4Z"/></svg></button>
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-headbtn aicourse-ai-expand" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_expand, format_aicourse {{/cleanstr}}" title="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_expand, format_aicourse {{/cleanstr}}" data-expandlabel="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_expand, format_aicourse {{/cleanstr}}" data-collapselabel="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_collapse, format_aicourse {{/cleanstr}}"><svg class="aicourse-ai-icon-expand" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7"/></svg><svg class="aicourse-ai-icon-collapse" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 14h6v6M20 10h-6V4M14 10l7-7M3 21l7-7"/></svg><span class="aicourse-ai-headbtn-text">{{#str}} aiassistant_studyview, format_aicourse {{/str}}</span></button>
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-close" id="aicourse-ai-close" aria-label="{{closelabel}}"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-body">
<aside class="aicourse-ai-rail" aria-label="{{#cleanstr}} aiassistant_tools_heading, format_aicourse {{/cleanstr}}">
<div class="aicourse-ai-rail-section">
<div class="aicourse-ai-rail-label">{{#str}} aiassistant_context_heading, format_aicourse {{/str}}</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-context-card">
<span class="aicourse-ai-context-kind">{{contextkind}}</span>
<span class="aicourse-ai-context-title" dir="auto">{{contexttitle}}</span>
{{#coursename}}<span class="aicourse-ai-context-course" dir="auto">{{coursename}}</span>{{/coursename}}
</div>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-rail-section">
<div class="aicourse-ai-rail-label">{{#str}} aiassistant_tools_heading, format_aicourse {{/str}}</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-rail-tools">
{{#tools}}
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-quick-btn aicourse-ai-tool aicourse-ai-tool-rail" data-prompt="{{key}}"><span class="aicourse-ai-tool-icon">{{> format_aicourse/chatbox_icon }}</span><span class="aicourse-ai-tool-text"><span class="aicourse-ai-tool-label">{{label}}</span><span class="aicourse-ai-tool-desc">{{desc}}</span></span></button>
{{/tools}}
</div>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-rail-foot">{{#str}} aiassistant_integrity_note, format_aicourse {{/str}}</div>
</aside>
<div class="aicourse-ai-main">
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-messages" id="aicourse-ai-messages" role="log" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions" dir="auto">
<div class="aicourse-ai-message aicourse-ai-message-bot aicourse-ai-message-welcome" id="aicourse-ai-welcome">
<span class="aicourse-ai-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 8V4H8"/><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"/><path d="M2 14h2M20 14h2M15 13v2M9 13v2"/></svg></span>
<div class="aicourse-ai-message-body"><div class="aicourse-ai-message-content">{{{welcome}}}</div></div>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-quick-actions" id="aicourse-ai-quick-actions">
<div class="aicourse-ai-quick-label">{{#str}} aiassistant_quick_label, format_aicourse {{/str}}</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-quick-buttons">
{{#tools}}
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-quick-btn aicourse-ai-tool aicourse-ai-tool-card" data-prompt="{{key}}"><span class="aicourse-ai-tool-icon">{{> format_aicourse/chatbox_icon }}</span><span class="aicourse-ai-tool-text"><span class="aicourse-ai-tool-label">{{label}}</span><span class="aicourse-ai-tool-desc">{{desc}}</span></span></button>
{{/tools}}
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-suggest" id="aicourse-ai-suggest" hidden>
{{#tools}}
<button type="button" class="aicourse-ai-quick-btn aicourse-ai-chip" data-prompt="{{key}}">{{> format_aicourse/chatbox_icon }}<span>{{label}}</span></button>
{{/tools}}
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-chatbox-input">
<div class="aicourse-ai-composer">
<label class="accesshide" for="aicourse-ai-input">{{inputlabel}}</label>
<textarea id="aicourse-ai-input" dir="auto" rows="1" placeholder="{{placeholder}}"></textarea>
<button type="button" id="aicourse-ai-send" class="aicourse-ai-send-btn" aria-label="{{sendlabel}}" title="{{sendlabel}}"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"/></svg></button>
</div>
<div class="aicourse-ai-composer-hint" aria-hidden="true">{{#str}} aiassistant_composer_hint, format_aicourse {{/str}}</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
